### Register a traveller
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "traveller@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Log in
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "traveller@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}
